    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d806-a2">

                <pb facs="0838" n="788" xml:id="pg788"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 145.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bartleman to Mr. Henderson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am informed that instructions have been sent to clear <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bolivar</hi> for Trinidad, provided bonds for 10,000 bolivars are given.
                    This is the best I can do. It is better that the act is not repeated. I write by
                    this mail, and await your dispatch with full particulars.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bartleman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
